    "description": "Tarana Wireless develops fixed-wireless broadband equipment designed to improve network economics and performance. Its customers include broadband service providers that deploy access infrastructure to reach homes and businesses in hard-to-serve or capital-constrained markets. The business follows a technology and equipment model centered on radio hardware, software, and service-provider channel relationships rather than ownership of regulated networks. Public materials identify a 2009 founding year and indicate that Tarana’s technology has been deployed by hundreds of operators across dozens of countries and most U.S. states. I Squared participated in Tarana’s March 2022 financing round through its InfraTech strategy; the resulting ownership percentage is not publicly disclosed. The investment gives I Squared exposure to broadband-enablement technology complementary to its fiber and digital-infrastructure holdings.",
